@ Start

$ Background {&/Game/Melodia/UI/Textures/Figma/T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_SpaceCathedral.T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_SpaceCathedral} none 0

- Melusina
  Three measures home, and the staircase brings us all the way to the roof balustrade. Wait... why is the wind salt-heavy up here?

      $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_arrival_01.mel_arrival_01} 0.9

- Sir Melodious
  Do not look down at the courtyard, Melusina. Look up past the flying buttresses.

- .
  Beside Melusina's boots, the Choral Sheep tilts its head skyward, its bronze bell chiming a soft, reverent C as cyan water-light ripples across the ivory stone.

      $ SFX {&/Game/Melodia/Companions/ChoralSheep/Audio/sheep_baa_PCC_small_01.sheep_baa_PCC_small_01} 0.8

* Step to the balustrade rail and look into the zenith. | -> ApproachEdge
* Hold the WaveHarp aloft to feel the sixteen-second pulse. | -> WitnessSeaAbove

<@> ApproachEdge

- Melusina
  That isn't cloud cover. Those are currents—kelp shadows and sapphire swells rolling upside-down across the heavens!

- Sir Melodious
  The Sea Above. The false ocean that roofs our world, held aloft by the standing-wave tension of the Great Cathedral and the breath of the Faraway Mother.

- Melusina
  Every sixteen seconds, the whole sky inhales... and the rain falls upward into the surf.

-> WitnessSeaAbove

<@> WitnessSeaAbove

- .
  High above the gothic spires, an immense inverted ocean rolls in sapphire and turquoise waves. On the sixteenth beat, a bioluminescent Chladni pulse radiates across the celestial membrane—sending pearlescent droplets drifting upward like inverted rain.

      $ SFX {&/Game/Melodia/Audio/WaveHarp/SW_WaveHarp_Orchestra_C4.SW_WaveHarp_Orchestra_C4} 0.85

- Sir Melodious
  That is where the festival carts went, little bard. Not down the road—up the tide-line. And listen: the fourth and final chamber of your Morning House is unsealing behind us.

$ Notify melodia:travel:/Game/EnvSandbox/Monoliths/SeaAbove/Prototype/LV_SeaAbove_Prototype
$ Notify melodia:stat:intent.sea_above.witness:melodia_resonance:5
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.cutscene.sea_above_witnessed:true
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.sea_above.membrane_pulse_active:true

- Melusina
  I thought arriving late meant the song was over. It wasn't over—that was just the tuning before the overture.

      $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_halfsong_02.mel_halfsong_02} 0.9

- Sir Melodious
  With the First Echo resolved, the Sorrow Seam upon your shoulders, and our Choral Sheep holding the root note, the Starskiff at the Shorewake dock will answer your hand.

$ Notify melodia:questcomplete:quest.cutscene.sea_above:flag.cutscene.sea_above_completed:reward.cutscene.sea_above_memory:intent.cutscene.sea_above.complete:checkpoint.cutscene.sea_above.complete

@ Finish

- .
  All four measures of the Morning Sanctuary stand open. Above the cathedral towers, the Sea Above pulses in sixteen-second cadence—awaiting Melusina's departure aboard the Starskiff.

$ End
